<title>UK: Norway's Ekofisk Nov loading off 1 mln at 13.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Norway's Ekofisk Nov loading off 1 mln at 13.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Ekofisk crude oil pipeline system is due to load 13.8 million barrels in November, down one million barrels from October, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The November programme will consist of eight cargoes of 600,000 barrels and 18 cargoes of 500,000 barrels.  </p>
<p>This compares with 13 cargoes of 500,000 barrels, 12 of 600,000 barrels and one each of 570,000 barrels and 550,000 barrels in the original October programme.</p>
<p>In the November programme, six cargoes are scheduled to load in the first decade, nine in the second decade and 11 in the third decade.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
